      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Circuitborn (Synapse Line)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You do not remember. You archive.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Memory-Print.</strong> You perfectly recall the last 24 hours. As a bonus action, you may replay a scene fragment to an ally (granting reroll the lowest die on one Investigation (Mind) (Mind), Lore (Mind), or Insight (Soul) (Soul) checks [TODO(adv-call)] about it).</p>",
